# .gitignore — Weather Dashboard
#
# This file tells Git which files and folders to ignore.
# Ignored files will NOT be included in commits or pushed to GitHub.
#
# Rules:
#   - Lines starting with # are comments.
#   - A trailing / means "only match folders, not files".
#   - A leading / means "only match in the project root".
#   - * is a wildcard (matches anything).

# ─── Operating System Files ──────────────────────────────────────────

# macOS metadata files created automatically by Finder.
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*

# Windows thumbnail cache files.
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# Windows shortcut files.
Desktop.ini

# ─── Editor and IDE Files ─────────────────────────────────────────────

# VS Code workspace settings (personal preferences, not project config).
# The folder itself is fine to commit if it contains shared settings,
# but .history contains local undo history and should not be shared.
.vscode/settings.json
.vscode/.history/

# JetBrains IDEs (WebStorm, etc.)
.idea/

# Sublime Text
*.sublime-workspace

# ─── Logs and Temporary Files ─────────────────────────────────────────

*.log
npm-debug.log*

# ─── Local Browser and Test Profiles ──────────────────────────────────
.chrome_profile/

# ─── Local Environment and Secrets ────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── DO NOT IGNORE — required source files ───────────────────────────
# The entries below explicitly ensure these files are NEVER ignored,
# even if a parent rule would otherwise match them.

!index.html
!css/
!css/style.css
!js/
!js/script.js
!js/weather.js
!js/ui.js
!js/cities.js
!README.md
!PROJECT.md
!AGENTS.md
!PRD.md
!TKD.md
!DESIGN.md
